  "verseCount": 19,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "22",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Daudini waan jed'e, Tunini fulla Mani AABBO Waaqa jiraachu male. Fullaani worri Israeli sorio gubani irati baasu tana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Mana Waaqa ijaarsaa kurfefatani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudini nama gosa Israeli intahini, ka lafa worraa keesa jiru, wolti yaame huji hojachiise. Worri hagi toko d'akha Mana Waaqatini jaarani boch'e mid'aase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni sibiila heddu ka musubaara iraa mid'aasanifi miha balbalatifi sibiila diima heddu, ka nami dandae ulfinna isaa haga imbeenne, worrati kenne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle inni worra Tirotifi ka Sidoni, mukha hind'eesa heddu muumme inqamne naa kootani jed'e, iraa fud'ate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonti akanatiifi Daudini waan jed'e, Mani Waaqa, ka ilmi kiyya Solomonini jaaru, mana mid'aaga lafa ch'ufa keesa beekhani, tahu male. Ammo inni ijoolle, ammalle arga d'ageeti inqabu, tanaafi anini waan ch'ufa isaa kurfeesu male, duuba sunifi Daudini ato induiini miha heddu muumme inqamne kurfeesefi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani inni ilma isaa Solomoni yaame waan jed'eeni, Waan atini taatu, Mana AABBO Waaqa Israeliti jaari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.1+2SA.7.2+2SA.7.3+2SA.7.4+2SA.7.5+2SA.7.6+2SA.7.7+2SA.7.8+2SA.7.9+2SA.7.10+2SA.7.11+2SA.7.12+2SA.7.13+2SA.7.14+2SA.7.15+2SA.7.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 7.1-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.17.1+1CH.17.2+1CH.17.3+1CH.17.4+1CH.17.5+1CH.17.6+1CH.17.7+1CH.17.8+1CH.17.9+1CH.17.10+1CH.17.11+1CH.17.12+1CH.17.13+1CH.17.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Od-dur 17.1-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ilma kiyya, Anini sila qara Mana AABBO Waaqa kiyya jaaru fed'e, aka akasiini maqa isaa guddisu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo AABBO Waaqi qonqo nati erge waan nani jed'e, Atini guddo duulte nama hedu haate fit'e, tanaafi waan atini d'iiga nama heddu buufteefi mana naa jaaru himmalle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amma ilmati sii d'alata, ka nagayaani lafa fiddu, wonti akanatiifi anini nagaya isaa kenne, nyaapa isaa ch'ufa duraa balleesa. Maqa isaa Solomoni baasiifi, wonti akanatiifi bara inni lafa fidu anini lafa Israeli nagayafi bad'aad'a tolcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami mana naa jaaru isuma; inni ilma na tahe anini abba isaa taha. D'alooti isaaleeni haga jiru Israeli mohata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amma, ilma kiyya, AABBO Waaqi kanke si woliini jiraatinna, ammalle inni ha kakhu ufi guutu, aka atini mana isaa jaartu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle AABBO Waaqi kanke qalbiifi beekha sii kennina, aka atini gosa Israeli Seera isaa gula fiddu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.1.6+JOS.1.7+JOS.1.8+JOS.1.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 1.6-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yo atini aadaafi seera AABBO Waaqi Musani gosa Israeliti kenne guute, atini waan ch'ufa dabsate gurra baafata. Insodaatini, garaa jabaad'i, waan tokole ind'eetini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana atini jaaru malte kana anini yayu irruma tiyyaani worqi ulfinni isii kilo kuma maro kuma saditifi kuma d'ibba afuritiifi qarsi ulfinni isii kilo kuma maro kuma d'ibba saditifi afurtama olkaye. Suni male sibiila diimafi sibiila d'ibi hedu ka nami dandae haga isaa imbeenne ya kurfeese olkaye. Ammalle mukhaafi d'akhale ch'ufa ya kurfeese, ammo atini iti daru malte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atini nama hogeeyi si hojattu heddu qabda: nama d'akha boch'u, nama d'akhaani mana jaaru, nama mukhaani woi jaaru, ammalle hogeeyi aka ch'ufa, ta henna inqamne, ta ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "worqifi qarsifi sibiila diimafi sibiila d'ibileeni woi mid'aasitu. Amma kai, huji hojad'i, AABBO Waaqi si woliini jira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudini jaarole Israeli ch'ufa wolti yaame, Solomoni qarqaara jed'eeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni ammalle waan worraani jed'e, AABBO Waaqi keesani isani woliini jiraate, mirgaafi bitaani teesani ch'ufti nagaya taate. Inni nama duri lafa tana keesa tau ch'ufa harka kiyyati kenne, worri sunini amma isaanifi AABBO Waaqa jalati bula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amma qalbiifi garaa keesanini AABBO Waaqa keesani hojad'a. Kaa, Mana AABBO Waaqa jaara, aka Sanduqa Wold'aqisa AABBO Waaqatifi miha woyyuma keesa olkeetani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.22.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
